# =============================================================================
# Ordering - Admin Orders API Smoke Tests
# =============================================================================

### Create order – success (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ordering/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

### Get order by ID – success (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ordering/orders/{{nonExistentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### List orders – success (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ordering/orders?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create order – no auth (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ordering/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}
